            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/0da20a80ac9fdf08990d47e98c5d6308.webp?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiesta Online is a unique free to play anime MMORPG played by an active and friendly community. In a magical and colorful world, players assume the role of a fantasy hero and brave powerful enemies and challenging quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With regular updates and more than 145 levels, hundreds of hours of gameplay content await you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/8bf509879fb5f313f3539d9b32432ad0.webp?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/9125fbda9c7ffa79300b88d6dab9dee5.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fantasy hero among five different character classes. Each class is equipped with different skills and plays a different role. You are not limited to only one character. You can change and experience the game in a new perspective. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trickster </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusader</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/a9ee4a44cc0be1617978e4a07b282877.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday new adventures await you thanks to a Daily Quest System rewarding you with fame and bonuses. You can also take part in epic Kingdom Quests to help your character make friends and level up.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/34bc3ea792a31b47ce08efed937bf4bd.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a member of a guild and have fun while playing Fiesta together. Fight together mighty bosses in dungeons and become the most powerful guild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/7944b106b79d8c7578ee106cc4bc30b7.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a new type of team play to progress easily and fast in the game! Gain levels faster as Apprentice and pass on your knowledge as Master.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/44249557689825fc55075c4ac2846081.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in numerous in-game events and organize parties where you can dance with your friends. Find a partner who will stay on your side throughout your adventures and get married.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fun with us, thousands of players await you!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/0da20a80ac9fdf08990d47e98c5d6308.webp?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiesta Online is a unique free to play anime MMORPG played by an active and friendly community. In a magical and colorful world, players assume the role of a fantasy hero and brave powerful enemies and challenging quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With regular updates and more than 145 levels, hundreds of hours of gameplay content await you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/8bf509879fb5f313f3539d9b32432ad0.webp?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/9125fbda9c7ffa79300b88d6dab9dee5.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fantasy hero among five different character classes. Each class is equipped with different skills and plays a different role. You are not limited to only one character. You can change and experience the game in a new perspective. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trickster </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusader</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/a9ee4a44cc0be1617978e4a07b282877.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday new adventures await you thanks to a Daily Quest System rewarding you with fame and bonuses. You can also take part in epic Kingdom Quests to help your character make friends and level up.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/34bc3ea792a31b47ce08efed937bf4bd.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a member of a guild and have fun while playing Fiesta together. Fight together mighty bosses in dungeons and become the most powerful guild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/7944b106b79d8c7578ee106cc4bc30b7.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a new type of team play to progress easily and fast in the game! Gain levels faster as Apprentice and pass on your knowledge as Master.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/300970/extras/44249557689825fc55075c4ac2846081.avif?t=1787601115\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in numerous in-game events and organize parties where you can dance with your friends. Find a partner who will stay on your side throughout your adventures and get married.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fun with us, thousands of players await you!</p>",
            "short_description": "Gather your fearless allies in the heart-pounding realms of Fiesta Online, where the fate of Isya rests on your shoulders. Prepare to wage war against the malevolent grip of Legel's corruption, forging powerful bonds with fellow adventurers as you embark on quests that will push you to your limits.",
